<title>USA: BEFORE THE BELL -- PepsiCo falls before open.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL -- PepsiCo falls before open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in PepsiCo Inc dropped before Tuesday's market openings on earnings that were below expectations, traders said.</p>
<p>PepsiCo was down 1-1/8 at 33. The company early Tuesday reported earnings per ongoing share of $0.24, against $0.35 an ongoing share, for the same period last year.</p>
<p>&quot;Their earnings were light, and they are down,&quot; a trader said. The First Call consensus estimate for earnings per share had been $0.32.</p>
</text>
